{"id":356,"name":"Dusclops","slug":"dusclops","types":["ghost"],"generation":3,"region":"Hoenn","favoriteRank":null,"artworkUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/356.png","flavorText":"DUSCLOPS’s body is completely hollow - there is nothing at all inside. It is said that its body is like a black hole. This POKéMON will absorb anything into its body, but nothing will ever come back out.","description":"Dusclops is the Beckon Pokémon, a Ghost-type first discovered in the Hoenn region. It stands 5'03\" (1.6 m) tall and weighs 67.5 lbs (30.6 kg). There are rumors that peeking inside its bandage-wrapped body will cause one to get pulled in through the gaps between the bandages, never to return. I've been too scared to verify. It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery.","evolution":{"from":{"id":355,"name":"Duskull"},"to":[{"id":477,"name":"Dusknoir"}]},"family":{"stages":[[{"id":355,"name":"Duskull"}],[{"id":356,"name":"Dusclops"}],[{"id":477,"name":"Dusknoir"}]],"megas":[]},"cards":[{"rank":1,"cardId":"ex9-94","name":"Dusclops ex","set":"Emerald","rarity":"Rare","imageUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/ex/ex9/94/high.webp","thumbUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/ex/ex9/94/low.webp","price":110,"currency":"USD","variant":"holofoil"},{"rank":2,"cardId":"ex8-7","name":"Dusclops","set":"Deoxys","rarity":"Rare","imageUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/ex/ex8/7/high.webp","thumbUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/ex/ex8/7/low.webp","price":61.54,"currency":"USD","variant":"reverse-holofoil"},{"rank":3,"cardId":"ex2-4","name":"Dusclops","set":"Sandstorm","rarity":"Rare","imageUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/ex/ex2/4/high.webp","thumbUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/ex/ex2/4/low.webp","price":26.82,"currency":"USD","variant":"holofoil"},{"rank":4,"cardId":"ex14-17","name":"Dusclops","set":"Crystal Guardians","rarity":"Rare","imageUrl":"https://asse